From 56493a2aa5fa528723f0f0db201299392fd50a58 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Senior Matthew <SeniorMatt@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 10:42:26 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 02/31] kcm_clock: Form page with current time first, time zone
 map on a sub-page
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Page type: Form (docs/page-design.md). Behaviour, timedated calls, polkit/KAuth and config are unchanged.

Moved / renamed:
- Top of the page now answers "what time is it": current date and time (heading) and current time zone,
  then the one common choice, "Set date and time automatically" (kcm_clock/Set-date-and-time-automatically).
- "Set Time" / "Set Date" -> "Set Time…" / "Set Date…" with icons, in a "Set manually:" row. They are disabled,
  not hidden, while automatic is on (kcm_clock/Set-Time, kcm_clock/Set-Date).
- The time zone map and region/zone lists moved from the main page to a sub-page (kcm.push TimeZonePage.qml),
  opened by a "Change Time Zone…" button under a "Time zone" section (kcm_clock/TimeZone). The selector is
  created asynchronously (Loader) with a busy indicator only after 150 ms.
- Page now uses Kirigami.FormLayout instead of Kirigami.Form/FormGroup.
- Relabel table: inventory/relabel/kcm_clock.tsv (outer repo). All 4 inventory rows kept, 0 lost.

Speed:
- The map (GeoJSON of all zones, QtLocation map, one polygon item per zone) is no longer built when the page opens.
- timedated properties (CanNTP, NTP) are now read with an async GetAll call instead of two blocking property
  getters in load()/refresh(); the checkbox enables when the reply arrives.
- Numbers: before (fast, no CPU limit) frame 954-1099 ms, ready 1156-1328 ms; slow (0.5 CPU) frame 4601 ms,
  ready 5402 ms (build/bench/clean/before-*.tsv). After: pending, see the outer repo.

HIG: HIG-001, HIG-005, HIG-006, HIG-013 (design doc: disabled instead of hidden), HIG-017, HIG-019, HIG-020,
HIG-023, HIG-047, HIG-058, HIG-062.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01X5N5x9eWzmrq6QYrYLwQnk
